{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.BallotNumbers","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.qint_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.qint_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/TwoRowCatalan.lean#L63-L69","doc":"`[m]_q ≠ 0` when `q ≠ 0`, `q² ≠ 1` and `q^(2m) ≠ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.qint_num_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.qint_num_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/TwoRowCatalan.lean#L52-L61","doc":"The numerator of `[m]_q` is nonzero when `q ≠ 0` and `q^(2m) ≠ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.qint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.qint","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/TwoRowCatalan.lean#L48-L50","doc":"The quantum integer `[m]_q = (q^m − q⁻¹^m)/(q − q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.twoRow_sum_sq_eq_catalan","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.twoRow_sum_sq_eq_catalan","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/TwoRowCatalan.lean#L40-L46","doc":"**Two-row Catalan identity.** `Σ_{0 ≤ k ≤ n/2} (C(n,k) − C(n,k−1))² = C_n`.\nA restatement of `QOU.Mathlib.ballot_sq_sum_catalan` (proved there first); the count\n`f n k = #SYT(n−k, k)` is `QOU.SchurWeyl.TwoRowSYTBallot.numSYT_twoRow_eq_ballot`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.f_eq_ballot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.f_eq_ballot","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/TwoRowCatalan.lean#L34-L38","doc":"`f` is the corpus ballot number `QOU.Mathlib.ballot`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.f","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.TwoRowCatalan.f","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/TwoRowCatalan.lean#L28-L31","doc":"`f n k = C(n,k) − C(n,k−1)` (with `C(n,−1) = 0`): the number of standard\nYoung tableaux of the two-row shape `(n − k, k)`, by the hook formula. ","signatureChunk":0}]}